Fuyao Photo Info — original Android implementation, 2026.

Project conventions and documentation structure were inspected in the local
FuyaoColorPicker and FuyaoLocale projects owned by skyrocketingHong.
Build-number allocation, APK naming, system-bar handling and UI token patterns are adapted
from FuyaoLocale and FuyaoColorPicker (AGPL-3.0-only). Historic color tables and
image assets were not copied.

The style follows user-provided measurements and five local reference screenshots.
Apple and iPhone are marks of their respective owner; this is not an Apple app.
This local checkout uses SF Mono Regular copied from the macOS Terminal bundle.
The font binary and reference photographs are Git-ignored local assets and are
not covered by this project's AGPL-3.0-only source license. APKs built while the
font is present include it; builds without it use Android monospace.

Dependencies retain their upstream licenses and notices. The generated Gradle
Wrapper retains its upstream notices. Imported fonts and photographs retain
their own rights; the source-code license grants no additional rights to them.
